---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import doctorImg from '../../assets/images/doctor.webp';
---

<section class="section doctor" id="your-doctor" aria-labelledby="doctor-title">
  <div class="container doctor__inner">
    <Image
      src={doctorImg}
      alt="Dr. Jessica Hardner, DC"
      widths={[328, 537, 1074]}
      sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 537px, (min-width: 768px) 360px, 164px"
      class="doctor__photo"
      loading="lazy"
    />
    <div class="doctor__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Meet your doctor</p>
      <h2 id="doctor-title" class="h3">Dr. Jessica Hardner</h2>
      <p class="doctor__role">DC, Clinic Director</p>
      <div class="doctor__bio">
        <p>
          Dr. Jessica came to this work through experience, not theory. Her path started on a medical mission trip that
          opened her eyes to natural healing and sparked a lasting interest in the nervous system and how the body moves.
          She earned her undergraduate degree in sports medicine and exercise science from Mercyhurst University and her
          Doctor of Chiropractic from Sherman College of Chiropractic.
        </p>
        <p>
          She's been treating auto accident injuries in Newberry for years, and local attorneys refer their clients to
          her when those cases need documented care. Patients tend to use the same word about her exams: thorough. She'd
          rather take the extra time and find what's actually going on than move you through quickly.
        </p>
        <p>
          Outside the clinic she's a competitive Irish dancer, teaches at Newberry College, and you'll find her at the
          farmers market most weekends. She sponsors the local swim team and runs a yearly fundraiser for the food
          pantry. This is her community, not just where her office happens to be.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .doctor__inner { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 32px; }
  .doctor__inner :global(.doctor__photo) {
    width: 164px;
    height: 164px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    flex: none;
  }
  .doctor__copy { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; text-align: center; }
  .doctor__role { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.3; color: var(--text-body); }
  .doctor__bio { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-body); }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .doctor__inner :global(.doctor__photo) { width: 360px; height: 360px; }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .doctor__inner { flex-direction: row; justify-content: space-between; gap: 64px; }
    .doctor__inner :global(.doctor__photo) { width: min(537px, 42%); height: auto; aspect-ratio: 1; }
    .doctor__copy { flex: 0 1 647px; text-align: left; }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1680px) {
    .doctor__inner { justify-content: center; gap: 120px; }
    .doctor__copy { flex-basis: 760px; }
  }
</style>
